### 1. Health Check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. User Registration (Success)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dr. Sarah Connor",
  "email": "sarah.connor@university.edu",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "role": "researcher",
  "country": "United States",
  "interface_language": "English",
  "presentation_language": "English"
}

### 3. Duplicate User Registration (Should Fail 400)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dr. Sarah Connor",
  "email": "sarah.connor@university.edu",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!",
  "role": "researcher",
  "country": "United States",
  "interface_language": "English",
  "presentation_language": "English"
}

### 4. User Login (Success)
# @name loginRequest
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sarah.connor@university.edu",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 5. Invalid Login (Should Fail 401)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sarah.connor@university.edu",
  "password": "WrongPassword!"
}

### 6. Get Current User without Token (Should Fail 401)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### 7. Get Current User with Bearer Token (Pass JWT token from login step above)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRequest.response.body.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Update Theme Settings in MySQL
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users/me/theme
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRequest.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "app_theme_mode": "dark",
  "app_color_theme": "purple",
  "custom_primary_color": "#a855f7"
}
